height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相对</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（生热）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>多过程问题</h2>\n<p>&quot;拆过程&quot;原则：每个阶段分别列动能定理/能量守恒，公共点速度是衔接量。</p>\n<h2>邪修提示</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>选填功能题：<strong>全程动能定理</strong>一条路走到底，别分过程；</li>\n<li>摩擦生热：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>相对</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=f s_{相对}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相对</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，相对位移（传送带痕迹、板块相对滑动）一眼定位；</li>\n<li>&quot;恰好通过最高点&quot;：先算临界速度 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{gr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.3369em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7031em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6631em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3369em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再能量守恒；</li>\n<li>风险：动能定理的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>合</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{合}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">合</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 别漏掉任何力（尤其摩擦力方向与位移方向相反的负功）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["动能定理","机械能守恒","功能关系","功率","机车启动"],"summary":"功与能 功和功率 功： W = F s cos ⁡ θ W=Fs\\cos\\theta W = F s cos θ （ θ \\theta θ 为力与位移夹角）； 功率： P = W t = F v cos ⁡ θ P=\\dfrac{W}{t}","fit":[],"updated":"Mon Feb 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"mechanics","title":"力学"},{"slug":"energy","title":"功与能"},{"slug":"energy","title":"功与能"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"slope-energy-combined","title":"多过程能量计算·分段衔接（模板）","type":"example"}]}